     4990              and rvs-line-attr.obj-type  = tt-rvs-line.obj-type
     4991              and rvs-line-attr.gds-code  = tt-rvs-line.gds-code
     4992              and rvs-line-attr.pl-code   = tt-rvs-line.pl-code
     4993              and rvs-line-attr.rvs-code  = tt-rvs-line.rvs-code
     4994              and rvs-line-attr.attr-code = "rvd-reason" no-error.
     4995       if not available rvs-line-attr then do :
