     6176                "Не найдена строка сверки с recid " parrec-rvs-line " ."
     6177        view-as alert-box error.
     6178        return error.
     6179     end.
     6180     create tt-rvs-line.
     6181     buffer-copy buf_rvs-line to tt-rvs-line.
     6182     if parmode = 'ИЗМЕНЕНИЕ':U then do:
     6183     find first buf_rvs-doc exclusive-lock
